<div>
<h2>The empty chair</h2>
<p>No honoree is expected to collect the medal. Each one is placed on an empty chair in a replica of the dock and held in escrow.</p>
<p>It is handed over only if the honoree appears before a lawful court for the acts cited, and then it becomes part of that court's record.</p>
<p>The medal carries no flags, emblems or symbols of the Nazi regime, and no reference to execution.</p>
</div>
